        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Alarm",
            "\"If humanity can really survive these disasters, so be it. If not... new mechanoids, such as yourself, contain 'souls' that will carry on the human civilization and continue to flourish.\" "
